@JM.Asp.Versioning.Example_HostAddress = http://localhost:5174

### Available in every version
GET {{JM.Asp.Versioning.Example_HostAddress}}/First/A_IncludeOnV1?api-version=1.0
Accept: application/json

### Removed on v2: 200 in v1
GET {{JM.Asp.Versioning.Example_HostAddress}}/First/B_RemoveOnV2?api-version=1.0
Accept: application/json

### Removed on v2: 400 in v2
GET {{JM.Asp.Versioning.Example_HostAddress}}/First/B_RemoveOnV2?api-version=2.0
Accept: application/json

### Included on v2.1
GET {{JM.Asp.Versioning.Example_HostAddress}}/First/C_IncludeOnV2_1?api-version=2.1
Accept: application/json

### Included on v3: no version uses the default version (3.0)
GET {{JM.Asp.Versioning.Example_HostAddress}}/Second/C_IncludeOnV3
Accept: application/json

